		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Three-eyed, cerulean ogre spirit that lurks in shallow waters. Robes and skin are constantly moist.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (robes), <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 spear (close/near) +7 (2d6) or 1 spell +7, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Acid Dart (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One target in far takes 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fade (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Self. Become invisible for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Liquid Form (CHA Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 13. Turn into puddle of water for 2d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapeshift</strong>. In place of attacks, turn into any humanoid or back into original form.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
